    "title": "Hypoxic extent across cruises",
    "section": "",
    "text": "This report summarizes when (by cruise date and depth from CTD casts) and where (from interpolated oxygen fields) dissolved oxygen falls below a hypoxic threshold. The default threshold is 2.0 mg/L. Change params.o2_threshold in the YAML front matter or pass --execute-params when rendering:\nRun after processing and interpolation:"
  },
